  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During the fate war clash with Western Desert Immortal Gu Houses, Heavenly Court Gu Immortals gather around Zhao Shan He and Yu Zhu Zi as the pair activates the immortal killer move Sitting and Eating the Mountain Empty. Zhao Shan He cultivates food path and Yu Zhu Zi cultivates earth path. The move envelops the battlefield so Western Desert’s Immortal Gu Houses cannot dodge it. Afterward, Gu worms in those houses weaken and die, and many immortal essence beads of Gu Immortals inside begin to disintegrate and disappear. Western Desert’s side reads the hit as food path profundity that Immortal Gu Houses struggle to defend against, with food path inheritances scarce among their righteous path.",
      "chapters": [
        1925
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_zhao_shan_he",
        "char_yu_zhu_zi",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zhao Shan He and Yu Zhu Zi prepare and unleash the move again while Heavenly Court Gu Immortals hold the line, then leave by starlight teleport after Western Desert takes another hit. Heavenly Court Gu Immortals note that casting sitting and eating the mountain empty grows harder as the enemy learns, yet still expect Western Desert to collapse after a few more uses.",
      "chapters": [
        1926
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "western-desert-recast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Calamity Luck Altar the same combination lands with very little effect; the altar’s defense against food path is strong.",
      "chapters": [
        1927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "altar-resistance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_calamity_luck_altar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Southern Border Immortal Gu Houses are hit, Gu worms and immortal essence deplete out of thin air.",
      "chapters": [
        1929
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-hit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later recalls that during the fate war Western Desert’s Gu Immortals had few defenses against food path and were all hit by Heavenly Court’s combination killer move sitting and eating the mountain empty.",
      "chapters": [
        2053
      ],
